    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/24-thorndale-estate-dublin-hill-cork-city-cork-t23-k5c3\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 24 Thorndale Estate, Dublin Hill, Cork City.\r\n\r\nThis attractive two-bedroom end-of-terrace home has undergone a comprehensive refurbishment, resulting in a bright and practical interior with a fresh, neutral finish throughout. Externally, the property features a rendered façade, enclosed entrance porch and a low-maintenance walled front area. Its position overlooking an open green provides a pleasant and open outlook from the front of the home.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, the porch opens into a welcoming hallway leading to the open-plan kitchen, dining and living space. The newly fitted kitchen features contemporary cabinetry, generous worktop space and space left for integrated cooking appliances. Its open arrangement provides ample room for both dining and everyday living, while windows to the front and rear bring natural light through the space. A newly installed combi boiler further enhances the home’s practical modern upgrades.\r\n\r\nThe first floor comprises two well-proportioned bedrooms, both finished in calming neutral tones and offering flexibility for furnishings and storage. The newly renovated bathroom is fitted with contemporary sanitary ware and a drench shower enclosure. Stira stairs provide convenient access to the attic, offering useful additional storage.\r\n\r\nTo the rear is an enclosed, low-maintenance outdoor area combining paved and gravelled surfaces. A detached block-built garden shed is supplied with electricity, while an outside tap provides further convenience for garden maintenance and general outdoor use.\r\n\r\nSituated in the established residential area of Dublin Hill, the property is within convenient reach of Cork City and a range of local services and amenities, with transport connections available to the city centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nWith its comprehensive refurbishment, newly fitted kitchen, upgraded bathroom and practical outdoor space, 24 Thorndale Estate offers comfortable and manageable accommodation in a convenient Cork City location."
      },
